inl gleam_match_codegen () = Task ("GLEAM-MATCH-CODEGEN", "Gleam backend match codegen, found 2026-10-12 while writing apps/kino/spi/document.spi from_spi (both reproduce on the Kino domain build, worked around there): (1) a second match on a union already narrowed by an enclosing `| _ =>` branch emits a Gleam `case` with only the remaining arms, which Gleam rejects as inexhaustive (missing Us4InDoc/Us4InTest); emit an unreachable `_ -> panic` arm or the full case; (2) matching a single-case union returned by an inlined function (`match open_step ... with | Step (a, b, c) => ...`) emits a duplicate `_ ->` arm that references a/b/c, unbound there (Gleam: Unknown variable); a single-case union needs no default arm. Add both shapes as samples on the Gleam list; 2026-10-12 fixed by the compiler lane, committed by the user in feb8b9f7 (12:50): unbox emits no _ arm when one scrutinee covers every case and an explicit unreachable panic otherwise; samples gleam_match_narrowed / gleam_match_single_case on the Gleam list; the Gleam prelude split so spiral_math_pow is pure Gleam (gleam/float.power) and only emitted by Pow; residual: spiral_halt and 3 more Gleam prelude externals are still Erlang-only (JS-target programs that slice strings would fail); validation ladder running (compiler lane); CI confirmation 14:20: near_wallet gleam build --target javascript passes on ubuntu in run 38280264212; 17:40 compiler lane: done: a union match without fallback emits no _ arm when it covers every case of a single scrutinee, else _ -> panic \"spiral: union case ruled out by partial evaluation\" (fixes narrowed-second-match inexhaustive and duplicate _ arm with unbound vars; both reproduced pre-fix); Bend had the narrowed shape as a codegen error, now IO.die(...,3,\"\"); other backends checked fine; samples gleam_match_narrowed (exit 61) and gleam_match_single_case (exit 49) agree with C on 12 backends; ladder single-flight-20261012-115551 / hopac-122842 / restore 133540 identical on 3,793 rows, DISAGREE 0, 118 residual changes classified (94 Gleam prelude, 17 dead Dyn lets, 5 brzozowski dead unboxes, 2 omniledger F#), 24 new rows; bless deferred (two attempts hit compile timeouts under memory pressure, EXPECTED.tsv unchanged): run compiler-lane/bless-gleam2.ps1 when the gate is idle; 18:17 blessed by the compiler lane: EXPECTED.tsv changed by exactly the 118 reviewed residual-only rows + 24 new (3,874 -> 3,898 rows, nothing removed), bless run single-flight-20261012-174720 reproduces the ladder restore except 29 Calyx/Wgsl rows that are no-toolchain in the dev cache; pre-bless copy tmp/compiler-lane/EXPECTED-before-bless.tsv", TaskKind, P2, D3, 100u32, Done, "", "gleam,compiler,codegen", "current", "current")
