inl tibia_oracle_rng () = Task ("TIBIA-ORACLE-RNG", "Canary draws every random number from one global std::mt19937 seeded by std::random_device (src/utils/tools.cpp:449 getRandomGenerator; uniform_random/normal_random/boolean_random, 110 call sites in 18 files: combat.cpp 16, monster.cpp 17, game.cpp 13, ...); std::uniform_int_distribution is implementation-defined (MSVC and libstdc++ differ), so no simulator RNG can match it bit for bit: fidelity for RNG mechanics is distributional (sample each formula, compare with a goodness-of-fit test), and only deterministic mechanics are diffed exactly; a seed override (env var) in a locally built Canary still helps reproduce single scenarios; the C++ build is heavy (vcpkg), schedule it through the gate", TaskKind, P2, D4, 0u32, Planned, "TIBIA-LOCAL-WORLD", "tibia,oracle,canary", "current", "current")
