inl tibia_login_15x () = Task ("TIBIA-LOGIN-15X", "Canary 3.6.1 classic login (port 7171) rejects every client except the old 11.00 protocol (protocollogin.cpp getCharacterList: `else if (!oldProtocol) disconnectClient`), and OTClient reports it only as a lost connection (ERROR 10054); 15.11 clients log in over HTTP (login.php, not part of Canary) and then present the session key, which Canary builds as `email + \"\\n\" + password`; the probes skip the HTTP service and call g_game.loginWorld('@god', 'god', 'OTServBR-Global', '127.0.0.1', 7172, character, '', '@god\\ngod') directly; modern accounts log in by email ('@god' in schema.sql); write a tiny local login service (Spiral) when several accounts are needed; 2026-10-13 06:14 solved since 2026-10-12: direct g_game.loginWorld on the game port with session key '@god\\ngod', used by every probe", TaskKind, P2, D3, 100u32, Done, "TIBIA-LOCAL-WORLD", "tibia,protocol", "current", "current")
