inl tibia_canary_pitfalls () = Task ("TIBIA-CANARY-PITFALLS", "Canary setup pitfalls found 2026-10-12: scoop lua51 sets LUA_PATH/LUA_CPATH, which override Canary's require paths (\"no field package.preload['data-otservbr-global.lib.core.quests']\"), so clear them for canary.exe (tibia-local/world.ps1 does); the release zip holds only canary.exe/pdb, the datapack comes from the v3.6.1 source tag; the global datapack (otservbr.otbm, 176 MB) needs well over 1.2 GB while loading, the small data-canary datapack (canary.otbm 18.8 MB, 67 monster types, no rat, no spawns) starts in 30 s at 112 MB and suits arena scenarios that define their own spawns; /m on the player's own tile fails in the temple (\"There is not enough room\"), the radius form /m name,count,,radius places monsters around; experience stayed 4200 after a kill because data-canary green_frog.lua sets monster.experience = 0; its targetDistance = 6 makes it keep six tiles away, which looked like fleeing in the probes (health 25, melee 0..25 every 2000 ms before armor, observed hits 2..12): pick arena creatures with targetDistance 1 and non-zero experience, and treat each creature's Lua definition as the oracle for the simulator's creature table", TaskKind, P3, D1, 0u32, Planned, "TIBIA-LOCAL-WORLD", "tibia,canary", "current", "current")
