inl tibia_sim_policies () = Task ("TIBIA-SIM-POLICIES", "Policies as a compile-time union in apps/tibia/hunt_sim.spi (2026-10-12): Scripted (heal below 60, strike when adjacent), ScriptedHealingBelow threshold, RandomControl (uniform over wait/heal/strike); the hunt now draws the creature from creatures.stats_of Troll (50 health, melee 0..15) and the player's hit cap from damage.max_melee_damage_offensive 20 30 8; pinned on Rust and C: golden seed 7 = 10 kills, 178 gold, 81 health; scripted 220 kills vs random control 149 over seeds 1..20; heal-threshold sweep over seeds 1..10: 20/40 -> 114, 60/80 -> 112, 100/120 -> 105 kills; next: a learned policy (CEM over policy parameters, then the graph code) promoted only when it beats the tuned scripted baseline and the random control stays below; 2026-10-13 06:14 hunt_sim policies: Scripted, ScriptedHealingBelow, Tuned (through policy.spi heals/engages, with Approach), RandomControl, cavebot_baseline and tuned_cavebot_heal", Feature, P2, D4, 100u32, Done, "TIBIA-TYPED-RULES", "tibia,arena", "current", "current")
