inl eoie_edit_batch () = Task ("EOIE-EDIT-BATCH", "one-call multi-file edit: inline anchored replacements with expected counts, whole-file writes and apply_patch-style hunks, validated, rehearsed and applied atomically with before/after hashes in one receipt, LF preserved; replaces ~16.1k edits/writes (.Replace+WriteAllText, python re.sub, Edit/apply_patch/search_replace/write) and today's compiler pack scripts; source: transcript sweep 2026-10-13 22:13 over ~45k tool calls (claude 41.6k, codex 2.0k, opencode 1.1k, grok 0.2k; zed 8 threads parsed, tool shape not yet recognized); report in main's job tmp/sweep/intent-report.txt", Story, P0, D6, 0u32, Planned, "EOIE-ONE-CALL", "eoie,one-call,adoption", "current", "current")
inl eoie_jobs () = Task ("EOIE-JOBS", "one-call build/test/run with receipts plus a job registry: background runs with wall-clock timeout, completion notification instead of polling, process listing scoped to the calling session with CPU deltas, and stop by job id; replaces ~10k build/test/wait/process calls (build.ps1, test.ps1, monitor.ps1 752 calls, Start-Sleep, Get-CimInstance, Stop-Process) and would have prevented the 14 h runaway searches of 2026-10-13; source: transcript sweep 2026-10-13 22:13 over ~45k tool calls (claude 41.6k, codex 2.0k, opencode 1.1k, grok 0.2k; zed 8 threads parsed, tool shape not yet recognized); report in main's job tmp/sweep/intent-report.txt", Story, P0, D6, 0u32, Planned, "EOIE-ONE-CALL", "eoie,one-call,adoption", "current", "current")
inl eoie_table_query () = Task ("EOIE-TABLE-QUERY", "one-call table query over TSV/CSV/JSON: filter, group, count, join and diff two files by key columns (e.g. two suite results.tsv by id+backend), human table plus --json; replaces ~4.8k Import-Csv/Group-Object/ConvertFrom-Json/Measure-Object pipelines and the python difflib/json scripts; source: transcript sweep 2026-10-13 22:13 over ~45k tool calls (claude 41.6k, codex 2.0k, opencode 1.1k, grok 0.2k; zed 8 threads parsed, tool shape not yet recognized); report in main's job tmp/sweep/intent-report.txt", Story, P1, D5, 0u32, Planned, "EOIE-ONE-CALL", "eoie,one-call,adoption", "current", "current")
inl eoie_repo_state () = Task ("EOIE-REPO-STATE", "one-call repo and workspace state: git status grouped by area, diff classification by pattern, file hashes, clock with offset in every receipt; replaces ~3k git, ~3.6k Get-Date and ~0.7k hash calls; source: transcript sweep 2026-10-13 22:13 over ~45k tool calls (claude 41.6k, codex 2.0k, opencode 1.1k, grok 0.2k; zed 8 threads parsed, tool shape not yet recognized); report in main's job tmp/sweep/intent-report.txt", Story, P1, D3, 0u32, Planned, "EOIE-ONE-CALL", "eoie,one-call,adoption", "current", "current")
inl eoie_agent_guide () = Task ("EOIE-AGENT-GUIDE", "generated guide every client reads (AGENTS.md section, Claude/Codex/Grok/OpenCode/Zed): per intent, the eoie call that replaces the pwsh/python habit, with worked examples, generated from the command spec so it never drifts; plus a recurring sweep that reports each client's remaining pwsh/python share as the adoption metric; source: transcript sweep 2026-10-13 22:13 over ~45k tool calls (claude 41.6k, codex 2.0k, opencode 1.1k, grok 0.2k; zed 8 threads parsed, tool shape not yet recognized); report in main's job tmp/sweep/intent-report.txt", Story, P1, D3, 0u32, Planned, "EOIE-ONE-CALL", "eoie,one-call,adoption", "current", "current")
inl eoie_idiomatic_core () = Task ("EOIE-IDIOMATIC-CORE", "rewrite eoie's core as idiomatic Spiral the way apps/tibia is going: a GADT command algebra (operation indexed by its receipt type), existential handlers, HKT-style receipt/result views, no rust_global or !!!! macro blobs; Rust stays the compiled target (rayon for parallel walk/search); keep the 1000-line crate gate, which is paying off; foundation for the one-call verbs; source: transcript sweep 2026-10-13 22:13 over ~45k tool calls (claude 41.6k, codex 2.0k, opencode 1.1k, grok 0.2k; zed 8 threads parsed, tool shape not yet recognized); report in main's job tmp/sweep/intent-report.txt", Story, P1, D8, 0u32, Planned, "EOIE-ONE-CALL", "eoie,one-call,adoption", "current", "current")
inl eoie_zed_sweep () = Task ("EOIE-ZED-SWEEP", "the transcript sweep reads Zed threads (zstd JSON via zstd.exe) but finds no tool calls: learn Zed's tool-use record shape and add it so the adoption metric covers every client; source: transcript sweep 2026-10-13 22:13 over ~45k tool calls (claude 41.6k, codex 2.0k, opencode 1.1k, grok 0.2k; zed 8 threads parsed, tool shape not yet recognized); report in main's job tmp/sweep/intent-report.txt", Story, P3, D2, 0u32, Planned, "EOIE-ONE-CALL", "eoie,one-call,adoption", "current", "current")
inl eoie_one_call_spec () = Task ("EOIE-ONE-CALL-SPEC", "TDD spec for one-call eoie (user direction 2026-10-13 22:23): the hairiest commands invented from mined agent history are both the tutorial and the tests; eoie/spec/one-call.md holds cases (provenance, habit, fixture, command, exact expected output) ordered by recorded calls replaced; all start red; first slice: a runner that extracts the fenced blocks, builds the fixture in a temp root, runs eoie once and diffs the whole output, then implement eoie do <root> '<program>' (typed statement language, one receipt with clock) in the idiomatic Spiral core until cases 1-6 are green; extend cases from tmp/sweep/hairy.md clusters (2036 compound signatures, 11.5k calls)", Story, P0, D5, 0u32, Planned, "EOIE-ONE-CALL", "eoie,one-call,tdd", "current", "current")
inl hopacsota () = Task ("HOPACSOTA", "hopacsota: parallel core restarted from single-flight's evaluator, the Hopac way (fill-once cells, server-owned tables, local scheduler), determinism by construction, no record/replay; contract = spiral/apps/compiler/tmp/lanes/hopacsota/PLAN.md (decisions D1-D15, gates G1-G6, phases 0-7, scoreboard, decision-change log); gpt5parallel stays reference until Phase 6; user decision 2026-10-13 22:47, plan 2026-10-13 23:15", Epic, P0, D8, 0u32, Planned, "", "compiler,hopacsota,parallel", "current", "current")
inl hopacsota_research () = Task ("HOPACSOTA-RESEARCH", "hopacsota Phase 0 (no core code): R1 rest of Bend 2 (BendTT 6+, term_check/term_infer, emit_match/emit_task); R2 shared-state inventory with every access line; R3 per-specialization work/span from an instrumented single-flight copy on the mega roots + a scaling corpus (apps/spiral, all lib/spiral, generated N=10/100/1000 modules) -> the chains that make the span long and the D16 technique for each (parallel evaluation is required, R3 never decides whether); R4 Deferred DFS/BFS/random-seed worklist on single-flight, -Suite all residual hashes identical; gate numbers into spiral/apps/compiler/tmp/lanes/hopacsota/PLAN.md scoreboard", Story, P0, D4, 0u32, Planned, "HOPACSOTA", "compiler,hopacsota,research", "current", "current")
